{"t_ms": 1521203, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s1_030", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Banquet Dining Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel provides banquet dining services for weddings, conferences, corporate meetings, and private celebrations. Customized buffet and plated meal options are available to suit different event sizes and budgets. Guests planning an event should contact the Banquet Sales Team at least seven days in advance for menu planning and venue arrangements.", "Main Restaurant Timings\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Horizon Restaurant serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner daily. Lunch is available from 12:30 PM to 3:00 PM, while dinner is served between 7:00 PM and 10:30 PM. Reservations are recommended during weekends and public holidays. Smart casual attire is encouraged for all guests dining in the restaurant.", "Guest Complaint Resolution\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuest satisfaction is our highest priority. Any concerns regarding room facilities, cleanliness, dining, or hotel services should be reported to the Front Desk immediately. The hotel aims to acknowledge complaints promptly and resolve most issues within a reasonable timeframe. If required, matters may be escalated to the Duty Manager for further assistance and resolution."], "scores": [0.5788414478302002, 0.8577074408531189, 0.9112460613250732], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1197, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
